From: devkit maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] Remove nonexistent symbols from the library version script

TODO: Upstream this patch to keyutils. The two entries were introduced by
a28ec81569084ad9254239af1f16aee35ef0d52b and
badd34263aff2c53749774589310d232c31b8f4b, respectively, and remain in upstream
master c076dff259e99d84d3822b4d2ad7f3f66532f411.

Neither keyctl_restrict nor keyctl_dh_compute_kdf_alloc is declared or
implemented. LLD rejects version-script assignments to undefined symbols.
Remove only these invalid assignments, preserving the existing unversioned
export of keyctl_restrict_keyring and all implemented functions' versions.

diff --git a/version.lds b/version.lds
--- a/version.lds
+++ b/version.lds
@@ -76,8 +76,6 @@ KEYUTILS_1.6 {

 KEYUTILS_1.7 {
 	/* management functions */
-	keyctl_restrict;
 	keyctl_dh_compute_kdf;
-	keyctl_dh_compute_kdf_alloc;

 } KEYUTILS_1.6;
